# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of the editor
# or OS that wrote them. Keeps `git diff`/`git commit` free of whole-file
# line-ending churn when something writes CRLF on Windows. Binary files are
# auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Heritage symbol art is stored byte for byte as its source published it, and
# its record holds the source file's SHA-1, so line endings must never be
# normalized.
src/projects/family-tree/symbol-art/** -text
